// weave_spec.md §15.1: files placed in the SAME directory are merged
// into one implicit package — no package(...) call is needed between
// them at all (contrast examples/modules/, which demonstrates the
// cross-directory package(...) form instead). greet is defined in the
// sibling file greeting.weave and is visible here without qualification.
main = fn(args) {
	print(greet("Weave"))
	return 0
}
